OL,3,ATenth woman's body found as South
OL,4,AAfrica police probe killings
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice in South Africa say they have
OL,7,Fdiscovered another body in Ekurhuleni,
OL,8,Fto the east of Johannesburg, bringing
OL,9,Fthe number of women found dead there in
OL,10,Frecent months to 10.
OL,12,FThe body was found on Saturday morning
OL,13,Fand was identified by the friend with
OL,14,Fwhom she had been at a bar the previous
OL,15,Fevening.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
