OL,3,ATenth woman's body found as South
OL,4,AAfrica police probe killings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe local police commissioner said his
OL,7,Fforce could not rule out the
OL,8,Fpossibility that there was a serial
OL,9,Fkiller on the loose, noting
OL,10,Fsimilarities across the 10 deaths in
OL,11,FEkurhuleni, as well as another in
OL,12,FSoweto.
OL,14,FThe deaths have sparked a national
OL,15,Foutcry about the scale of violence
OL,16,Fagainst women in the country, which has
OL,17,Fone of the highest rates of
OL,18,Fgender-based violence in the world.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
